-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연계전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 과목 중 주전공 교과목이 아닌 참여 전공 교과목의 이수학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">복수전공 또는 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 해당 전공학점으로 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업 대상자 중에서 연계전공 이수자로 선발되었으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수포기 신청을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: -윤고딕130; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: -윤고딕130\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; 